                        <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Dual use of solar power plants as biocrust nurseries for large-scale arid soil restoration</h1>
                        <ul class="c-article-author-list c-article-author-list--short" data-test="authors-list" data-component-authors-activator="authors-list"><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click_view_author" data-track-action="open author" data-track-index="1_7" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Ana_Mercedes-Heredia_Vel_squez-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Ana_Mercedes-Heredia_Vel_squez-Aff1" data-track-label="Ana Mercedes Heredia-Velásquez" data-author-search="Heredia-Velásquez, Ana Mercedes">Ana Mercedes Heredia-Velásquez</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a></sup><sup class="u-js-hide"> <a href="#na1">na1</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click_view_author" data-track-action="open author" data-track-index="2_7" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Ana-Giraldo_Silva-Aff1-Aff2" data-author-popup="auth-Ana-Giraldo_Silva-Aff1-Aff2" data-track-label="Ana Giraldo-Silva" data-author-search="Giraldo-Silva, Ana">Ana Giraldo-Silva</a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
